# .vercelignore — deployment target: @zotlit/docs (apps/docs)
#
# `next build` in apps/docs pulls in only apps/docs itself plus its lone
# workspace dep, packages/config (tsconfig/oxlint presets, no workspace deps
# of its own). pnpm's frozen-lockfile install derives its project scope from
# pnpm-lock.yaml, so the sibling workspaces excluded below can be absent from
# the upload without breaking install. Root manifests + turbo.json stay.

# --- Sibling apps (not in the docs dependency graph) ---
/apps/obsidian
/apps/zotero
/apps/website

# --- Packages the docs build never imports ---
/packages/db
/packages/item-lookup
/packages/obsidian-api
/packages/pdfjs-dist
/packages/protocol
/packages/scripts
/packages/shared
/packages/templates
/packages/zotero-types

# --- Repo-level content unrelated to the build ---
/docs
/.scratch
/scripts

# --- Caches & build artifacts (regenerated on Vercel) ---
node_modules
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.source
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
